exports[`get_archive_info > narrates the collection's shape 1`] = `
"I've been to 11 concerts across 40 years, from 1984 to 2024 — 8 venues in 6 cities.

The artists I've seen most: Social Distortion (5), Depeche Mode (3), Adam Ant (1), Peter Gabriel (1), Peter Hook and the Light (1).
The rooms I keep returning to: Pacific Amphitheatre (4), Dodger Stadium (1), Hollywood Bowl (1), Irvine Meadows (1), Rose Bowl (1).
My busiest decade was the 1980s, with 3 shows.
More New Wave than anything else — 6 shows.

The longest I went without a show was 3060 days, between Peter Gabriel in May 2002 and Social Distortion in Sep 2010."
`;

