4. September 20, 2010 — [Pacific Amphitheatre](https://concerts.morperhaus.org/?scene=venues&venue=pacific-amphitheatre), Costa Mesa [concert-8]
5. October 25, 2024 — [Pacific Amphitheatre](https://concerts.morperhaus.org/?scene=venues&venue=pacific-amphitheatre), Costa Mesa [concert-9]

Known for Story of My Life and Ball and Chain.

Social Distortion is one of the artists I've seen most — 5 times over 34 years.

